{"source":"https://github.com/Zoinkwiz/quest-helper/blob/08bb7c55ffc5aa61b7f4df61820967d63157e389/src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/rovingelves/RovingElves.java","steps":[{"text":"Talk to Islwyn in Isafdar. If he's not at the marked location, try hopping worlds to find him here.","target":{"x":2207,"y":3159,"plane":0},"items":[{"id":12913,"name":"Antipoison potion","amount":1,"alternates":[12915,12917,12919,12905,12907,12909,12911,5952,5954,5956,5958,5943,5945,5947,5949,2448,181,183,185,2446,175,177,179,4842,4844,4846,4848,10925,10927,10929,10931,11437,11439,11433,11435,11501,11503]}],"choices":["Yes."]},{"text":"Talk to Eluned.","target":{"x":2207,"y":3159,"plane":0}},{"text":"Bank everything besides the pebble, some potions, and some food. After, go use Glarial's pebble to Glarial's Tombstone east of Baxtorian Falls. Be prepared to fight a level 84 Moss Guardian bare-handed.","target":{"x":2559,"y":3445,"plane":0}},{"text":"Kill the Moss Guardian for a Consecration seed.","target":{"x":2515,"y":9844,"plane":0}},{"text":"Pick up the consecration seed.","items":[{"id":4205,"name":"Consecration seed","amount":1,"alternates":[4206]}]},{"text":"Return the seed to Eluned.","target":{"x":2207,"y":3159,"plane":0}},{"text":"Board the log raft on the top of Baxtorian Falls.","target":{"x":2509,"y":3494,"plane":0},"items":[{"id":4206,"name":"Consecration seed","amount":1},{"id":954,"name":"Rope","amount":1},{"id":952,"name":"Spade","amount":1}]},{"text":"Use a rope on the rock to the south.","target":{"x":2512,"y":3468,"plane":0},"items":[{"id":954,"name":"Rope","amount":1}]},{"text":"Use a rope on the dead tree.","target":{"x":2512,"y":3465,"plane":0},"items":[{"id":954,"name":"Rope","amount":1}]},{"text":"Enter the falls.","target":{"x":2511,"y":3464,"plane":0}},{"text":"Search the crate in the east room for a key.","target":{"x":2589,"y":9888,"plane":0}},{"text":"Go through the doors from the west room.","target":{"x":2566,"y":9901,"plane":0},"items":[{"id":298,"name":"Key","amount":1}]},{"text":"Plant the consecrated seed anywhere in the room.","items":[{"id":4206,"name":"Consecration seed","amount":1},{"id":952,"name":"Spade","amount":1}]},{"text":"Return to Islwyn in Isafdar to finish the quest.","target":{"x":2207,"y":3159,"plane":0}}]}
